    <div class="phase-body"><p>You'll strip everything back to the foundation. Who are you? What's the story only you can tell? What makes your perspective worth following? This is where most people skip, and it's exactly why most people plateau. You'll leave this phase with a content identity so clear that every post writes itself.</p></div>
